{title: The First King}
{subtitle: Genesis 36:31–33; 36:33; 1 Chronicles 1:43–44; Genesis 36:1–9}
{key: Eb}
{tempo: 79}
{time: 4/4}

{comment: Intro}
| [Eb] | [Bb/D] | [Cm7] [Ebmaj7/Bb] | [Ab] |
