{start_of_verse: Verse 1}
[Eb]These are [Gm7]the kings who reigned [Ab]in the land
Before any king reigned [Bb]over the [Eb]Israelites
Bela son of [Gm7]Beor became king in [Ab]Edom
His [Bb]city was [Eb]named Dinhabah
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_chorus: Chorus}
The first [Ab]king in the [Bb]land of [Eb]Edom
Bela son [Cm7]of Beor ruled there
[Ab]Before kings came [Bb]to rule the [Cm7]tribes
His story is [Ab]written [Bb]in the books [Eb]
{end_of_chorus}

{start_of_verse: Verse 2}
Esau is Edom in the [Gm7]hill country of Seir
[Ab]He took his wives and moved away [Bb]from Jacob
Their pos[Eb]sessions were too great [Gm7]to live together
So [Ab]the lineage of kings [Bb]began to [Eb]grow
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_chorus: Chorus}
The first king in the [Ab]land of E[Bb]dom
[Eb]Bela son of Beor [Cm7]ruled there
Before [Ab]kings came to [Bb]rule the [Cm7]tribes
His story is [Ab]written [Bb]in the books [Eb]
{end_of_chorus}

{start_of_bridge: Bridge}
When [Ab]Bela died [Bb]Jobab son of [Cm7]Zerah succeeded him
[Ab]From Bozrah he [Bb]reigned in his [Cm7]place
[Ab]The list in [Bb]Chronicles [Cm7]confirms the name
Of the first [Ab]king of the Edomites
{end_of_bridge}

{start_of_chorus: Chorus}
[Eb]The first king in the [Ab]land of E[Bb]dom
[Eb]Bela son of Beor [Cm7]ruled there
Before [Ab]kings came to [Bb]rule the [Cm7]tribes
His story is [Ab]written [Bb]in the books [Eb]
{end_of_chorus}

{start_of_verse: Outro}
[Ab]Bela [Bb]son of [Cm7]Beor
[Ab]King of Dinha[Bb]bah
{end_of_verse}

